@startuml OctoTify_Sequence_Logout

skinparam sequenceStyle svg
skinparam linetype ortho

title 退出登录 (POST /api/auth/logout)

actor "用户" as User
participant "前端" as Frontend
participant "HTTPServer" as Server
participant "UserHandler" as Handler
participant "UserService" as UserSvc
database "SQLite" as DB

User -> Frontend: 点击退出登录
Frontend -> Server: POST /api/auth/logout
note right: Header: Authorization Bearer {accessToken}
activate Server
Server -> Handler: logout(req)
activate Handler

== JWT 认证中间件拦截 ==

alt 未提供认证令牌
    Handler --> Server: {code: 100001, msg: "未提供认证令牌"}
    Server --> Frontend: {code: 100001, msg: "未提供认证令牌"}
    Frontend --> User: 显示错误提示
else 认证令牌无效
    Handler --> Server: {code: 100001, msg: "认证令牌无效或已过期"}
    Server --> Frontend: {code: 100001, msg: "认证令牌无效或已过期"}
    Frontend --> User: 显示错误提示
else 认证通过
    Handler -> UserSvc: logout(userId)
    activate UserSvc

    == 撤销所有 Refresh Token ==

    UserSvc -> DB: UPDATE refresh_tokens SET revoked = 1 WHERE user_id = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> UserSvc: 更新行数
    deactivate DB

    alt 撤销令牌失败
        UserSvc --> Handler: ErrLogoutFailed (110802)
        Handler --> Server: {code: 110802, msg: "退出登录失败"}
        Server --> Frontend: {code: 110802, msg: "退出登录失败"}
        Frontend --> User: 显示错误提示，跳转至登录页
    else 撤销令牌成功
        UserSvc --> Handler: 成功
        deactivate UserSvc
        Handler --> Server: {code: 0, msg: "退出登录成功"}
        deactivate Handler
        Server --> Frontend: {code: 0, msg: "退出登录成功"}
        deactivate Server
        Frontend --> User: 跳转至登录页
    end
end

note over Frontend: 无论成功或失败\n前端均清除本地\nAccess Token 和 Refresh Token

note right: Access Token 在过期前仍有效\n（JWT 无状态特性，最长 1 小时后自动失效）\n前端需主动清除本地 token

@enduml
